  title: 'Biostatistician (Ndera Hospital) — Full Mock Exam 3',
  summary: 'A third full-length written-exam simulation, covering trial design biases, survival and categorical analysis, surveillance and research-ethics oversight, and analytical reasoning.',
  free: false,
